                <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p>Corelink Mini-Pro OTDR is applied to FTTx and access network construction and maintenance, to test fiber breakpoint, length, loss, and input light automatic detection, automatic test by one key. The tester is compact with 3.5-inch colorful LCD screen, a new plastic shell design, shock-proof, and drop-proof. The tester also combines 8 functions with highly integrated OTDR, Event maps, Stable Light source, Optical power meter, Visual fault locator, cable sequence proofreading, IL and lighting functions. It could quick detection of breakpoint, a universal connector, 600 internal storage, a TF card, USB data storage a built-in 4000mAh lithium battery, and USB charging. It is a good choice for long term field work.</p><p><br></p><h3>Specification:</h3><ul><li>Mini-Pro OTDR:</li><li>Wavelength: 1313/1550nm</li><li>Fiber type: G.652 SM Fiber</li><li>Dynamic range: 24dB/22dB</li><li>Event blind zone: 3m</li><li>ATT blind zone: 8m</li><li>Test range: 10m~60km</li><li>Pulse width: 5ns~10us</li><li>Ranging accuracy: ±(1m+Sampling Interval +0.005% x Test Distance)</li><li>Loss accuracy: ±0.2dB/dB</li><li>Sampling Points: 16k~128k</li><li>Sampling resolution: 0.05m~8m</li><li>Reflection accuracy: ±3dB</li><li>Data storage: Internal: ≥600; External: TF Card</li><li>Laser safety level: Class II level</li><li>File format: SOR standard file format</li><li>Connector: FC/APC (Interchangeable SC, ST)</li></ul><h3>OPM:</h3><ul><li>Wave range: 800nm~1700nm</li><li>Interface type: Universal Joint FC/SC/ST</li><li>Test range: -50dBm ~ +26dBm</li><li>Uncertainty: ±5%</li><li>Frequency identification: CW/270/330/1k/2kHz</li><li>Calibration wavelength: 850/1300/1310/1490/1550/1577/1625nm</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>LS:</h3><ul><li>LD type: FP-LD</li><li>Output wavelength: 1310/1550nm</li><li>Output power: ≥-5dBm</li><li>Modulation frequency: 270/330/1k/2kHz</li><li>Stability: CW, ±0.5dB/15min (Test after15mins of preheating)</li><li>Connector: FC/APC (Interchangeable SC, ST)</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>VFL:</h3><ul><li>Wavelength: 650nm±20nm</li><li>Output power: ≥10mW</li><li>Mode: CW/1Hz/2Hz</li><li>Connector: FC/SC/ST</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>Other parameters:</h3><ul><li>Display: 3.5inch Color LCD</li><li>Data interface: Micro USB</li><li>External storage: TF Card</li><li>Power supply: Polymer Li-battery: 3.7V, 4000mAh; Power adapter: 5V DC, 2A</li><li>Battery life: standby &gt;20h; measuring time &gt;12h</li><li>Operating temperature: -10â„ƒ ~ +50â„ƒ</li><li>Storage temperature: -40â„ƒ ~ +70â„ƒ</li><li>Relative humidity: 0 ~ 95% Non-condensing</li><li>Weight: ≤350g</li><li>Dimension: 173 x 82 x 37mm</li></ul><h3>Package Included:</h3><ul><li>1 x Host</li><li>1 x Adapter</li><li>1 x Data Line</li><li>1 x CD (Analysis software, User Manual)</li><li>1 x User Manual</li><li>1 x SC/APC Connector</li><li>1 x Calibration Certification</li><li>1 x Qualification Certificate/Service Guarantee Card</li><li>1 x Clean Cotton Slices</li><li>1 x Instrument Bag</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"bloc